    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: Simulated devices SD-S2c (§3.13c D-106 / D-107). The dv-drone-fly start, then the right stick held forward (0.6) flies the drone north toward a drone-jammer HMMWV (TKB 113, its 400 m bubble) 700 m away: 300 m out it enters the bubble and its radio link is JAMMED. The jammer is of another force (Neutral - so the run is a link test, not a fight). Judge: (1) the drone's link reads Jammed and lost (DroneLink); (2) the FAILSAFE: the sticks are ignored, it hovers (FailsafeHover) at the bubble's edge - it never flies deeper - then returns home (FailsafeReturn) although the stick is still forward, and lands; (3) the station shows FAILSAFE; (4) at the end it is down within 30 m of its launch point; (5) the OSD shows LINK LOST and the reason JAMMED (SD-S2d). Fail: the stick still flies it once jammed, or it does not come home. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh dv-drone-jammed"
  },
